lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI悄然资助父母与儿童安全AI联盟引发行业质疑与组织退出</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind发布Gemma 4开源模型系列，采用Apache 2.0协议</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持多代码仓库协同</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义实验室发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型，支持全模态输入与精准编辑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c3b901abb4903f434ab5254da4c224f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义实验室正式发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型，旨在解决AI视频创作中内容生成不专业及修改困难的痛点。该模型支持文本、图像、视频和音频的全模态输入，赋予用户对画面结构、剧情走向及局部细节的深度控制能力。在编辑功能上，Wan2.7-Video允许用户通过指令精准调整视频元素，包括删除路人、替换物体、转换背景环境及一键切换视觉风格。针对剧情创作，用户无需重新拍摄，即可通过指令修改角色的台词、动作及镜头角度。此外，该模型还具备创意快速复刻与剧情延续功能，通过精准的时序控制实现视频无缝衔接。Wan2.7-Video的推出，显著提升了视频创作的灵活性与便捷性，使用户能够像编辑文档一样对视频内容进行精细化修改，满足专业级创作需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next并开源核心架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ea451ea1cc00b712c9a5a1ef514b4363.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团技术团队正式发布并开源原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next，该模型摒弃了“语言基座+插件”的拼凑架构，通过自研DiNA（离散原生自回归）架构，将图像、语音与文本统一转化为同源的离散Token。在技术实现上，模型采用统一的参数、注意力机制和损失函数，通过dNaViT视觉分词器实现高达28倍的像素空间压缩，支持任意分辨率输入。实证性能显示，LongCat-Next在OmniDocBench密集文本场景中超越Qwen3-Omni及Qwen3-VL，在MathVista视觉推理测试中达到83.1分，同时保持C-Eval 86.80的语言能力。该模型实现了理解与生成的对称，支持低延迟并行文本语音生成及语音克隆。此次开源LongCat-Next及dNaViT分词器，旨在为开发者提供构建感知物理世界AI的底层工具，推</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI悄然资助父母与儿童安全AI联盟引发行业质疑与组织退出</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/44e1a09efaf95a2101de11705dc6767f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI被曝在未公开身份的情况下，悄然资助并推动“父母与儿童安全AI联盟”成立，引发行业对其透明度的质疑。该联盟在三月中旬向全国儿童安全组织发送邮件，寻求对年龄验证、家长控制及禁止针对儿童广告等AI监管原则的支持。然而，多名组织领导者在联盟正式公布后才获悉OpenAI是唯一资助方，部分组织因认为沟通存在误导而选择退出。联盟发言人回应称，OpenAI正与其他六个成员共同争取美国最强的儿童AI安全法律。但批评者指出，OpenAI此举具有“草根运动”伪装色彩，容易误导公众。此前OpenAI曾因反对部分更严格的儿童安全立法而面临压力，此次隐秘资助行为进一步加剧了外界对其在制定AI监管规则时动机的担忧，行业呼吁应由更具经验的儿童权益倡导者主导相关立法进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind发布Gemma 4开源模型系列，采用Apache 2.0协议</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f26fdc3cf88181acfdb0f18036c08096.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式发布新一代开源模型系列Gemma 4，并全面转向Apache 2.0协议，支持商用与二次开发。该系列包含四款模型：旗舰版31B Dense支持256K上下文，单张H100即可运行；26B A4B MoE采用混合专家架构，推理速度极快；E4B与E2B专为端侧优化，E2B内存占用可压至1.5GB以下。性能方面，Gemma 4在AIME 2026数学测试中得分达89.2%，Codeforces ELO评分升至2150。核心特性包括内置可开关的Thinking Mode、原生Agent支持及深度多模态能力，全版本支持图像与视频输入。此次发布标志着谷歌通过极致的端侧工程化与更开放的协议，重塑开源模型竞争格局，为开发者提供更强的编程辅助与智能体构建能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor 3 正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持多代码仓库协同</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/406b78eec862fc61ca34a2776c0327d4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor 3 正式发布，标志着软件开发模式从“人机协作”向“智能体自主工作”转型。新版本核心创新在于“智能体统一工作区”，允许用户在侧边栏集中管理本地及云端智能体，并支持从移动端、Web、桌面及 Slack 等多终端启动。该版本实现了本地与云端智能体会话的无缝切换，确保长时间任务在离线状态下仍可运行。在协作层面，Cursor 3 引入了简洁的差异视图 UI，优化了代码变更的编辑与审查流程，同时保持对语言服务器协议（LSP）、内置浏览器及各类插件的全面支持。用户现可通过升级 Cursor 并输入 Cmd+Shift+P 调出 Agents Window 体验新界面。Cursor 团队表示，此次更新旨在为构建更自主的智能体及实现代码库自我驱动奠定基础，未来将持续推动编程模型演进，以开启全新的交互模式。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
